      "system": {
        "notes": {
          "player": "",
          "gm": "<p>The Exorcist has Advantage on Discipline (Psychic) and Lore (Forbidden) Tests to exorcise an Individual (Inquisition Gamemasters Guide pg. 82). The Exorcist also gains +1SL on Attack Tests against Daemonhosts and other Daemon possessed individuals.  True Faith: The Ministorum Priest has 1 point of Fate.   War Hymn: The Ministorum Priest makes a Presence (Leadership) Test as an Action to intone a Hymn of Battle. If they succeed, they may choose an ally that can hear them from the Ecclesiarchy Faction. The next time that ally makes a melee attack, they may make a second melee attack.</p>"
